Package: DASRA
Type: Package
Title: Depth-Aware Structural-Absence and Relative-Abundance Analysis
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R:
    c(
        person("Yiqian", "Zhang", email = "zhang.16383@osu.edu",
               role = c("aut", "cre")),
        person("Zihan", "Zhu", email = "zihan.zhu@yale.edu",
               role = "aut")
    )
Description: Provides depth-aware taxon-level inference for microbiome count
    data. The method separates group differences in structural-absence
    probability from differences in relative abundance conditional on taxon
    presence, accounts for finite-depth nondetection through a latent-state
    count model, and corrects the abundance component for a shared
    compositional background across taxa.
